# Changelog required

When changing this package, always update:

- `CHANGELOG.md` (dated section + bullets)
- `docs/changes/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` for non-trivial changes
- `docs/README.md` index row for each new change note

Do not leave changelog updates for a follow-up commit.
